{"id":"09d08f3e4b6f7fbb","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gl-decidable.md","title":"GL is Decidable","display":"cor-gl-decidable — GL is Decidable","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gl-decidable","aliases":["89-cor-gl-decidable"],"display":"cor-gl-decidable — GL is Decidable","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","[[89-thm-gl-decidability]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gl-decidable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gl-decidable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gl-decidable — GL is Decidable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b619488086561ea\" href=\"?note=1b619488086561ea\" title=\"89-thm-gl-decidability\">89-thm-gl-decidability</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}\\)</span> is the decidability predicate for the\nGödel-coded GL theorem set, as defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"128a3cd6545693f6\" href=\"?note=128a3cd6545693f6\" title=\"89-df-gl-decidability\">89-df-gl-decidability</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> : GL逻辑 (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a>)</li>\n<li>该记号展开后断言 GL 定理 Gödel 码集合是递归集</li>\n<li>模态逻辑的算法性质</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"1b619488086561ea","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-decidability]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-decidability","status":"resolved","id":"128a3cd6545693f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}$ is the decidability predicate for the\nGödel-coded GL theorem set, as defined in [[89-df-gl-decidability]].","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GL}$ : GL逻辑 (see [[89-df-gl-logic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}decidable}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Decidable}_{\\mathrm{GL}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false}],"bytes":745,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["128a3cd6545693f6","1b619488086561ea","0006800fa1c85177"]}